# Independent agent review: completed evidence transport

Verdict: PASS for the exact nine-entry reversible representation change, under the stated quiescent/cooperating-workspace assumption. This is an evidence-transport review; it changes no theorem, compiler, trust setting, cache admission or ownership audit.

